[36m(TaskRunner pid=464017)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=464017)[0m We need \( b + 7 \) to divide \( 9b + 7 \). This translates to the condition that \( b + 7 \) divides \( 9b + 7 \). We can express this as:
